#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Ryzeal Mitsurugi, summer 2025 (Anselm "Habakiri")
#title Ryzeal Mitsurugi (2025, uncut)
#era 2025
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won YCS Providence (May 2025, 1,572 players) in the format where Mitsurugi took a third of every premier top cut. Ame no Habakiri and the Mitsurugi Rituals tribute for on-field negation and removal on either turn; the Ryzeal engine and Seventh Tachyon add Rank 4 Xyz plays. Here with three Habakiri and the old free altars: every Tribute fires a Mitsurugi trigger.
#why Peak list: May 2025; restored: Ame no Habakiri no Mitsurugi x3; picks: Mass Driver, Pharaonic Advent, Sinister Serpent, King of the Feral Imps (Extra, already in the list); cuts: Droll & Lock Bird x3 (flex), Number 41: Bagooska (Extra; an Alley exclusion, so the Extra Deck is 14). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1683 (-184 under ryzeal 1867; the base's playbook is written for its own Mitsurugi Ryzeal list, so the gain over the base is not the measure here: the peak list as played rated 1689).
